  "sharedContent": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Ferry to Shetland Islands</span></strong><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Name of ferry company: (1) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> Ferries</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Ferries depart seven times per (2) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> in summer</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Cost for four people with car: a little less than (3) £ <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Cancellation policy: receive a (4) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> (if cancelled a month in advance)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Advice</span></strong><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Cabins:</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">o book one with a (5) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/></span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">o luxury cabins have a TV</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Bring snacks and (6) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> for the children</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• A (7) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> is required for the dog kennels</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• Try to see (8) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> in the morning</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• If time, visit (9) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> Castle</span><br/>\n<span style=\"color: #000000;\">• The (10) <input name=\"fname\" type=\"text\"/> restaurant in a nearby village is recommended</span><br/> <br/>\n<br/>\n<br/> </p>",
